ent et delivery pour injectable drugs, avec des acteurs établis et des nouveaux entrants possibles. Une intensification de la concurrence pourrait presser les marges. Citation: \"Our Operations We are a leading global manufacturer in the design and production of technologically\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "La société doit maintenir son avantage technologique et de qualité pour rester leader dans un secteur concurrentiel des systèmes d'administration injectable.", "score": 3}], "_validation_global": ["All KPI values verified against 10-K consolidated financial statements", "Gross Margin: 1,104.0 M$ / 3,074.1 M$ = 35.9% confirmed", "Operating Margin: 584.9 M$ / 3,074.1 M$ = 19.0% confirmed", "R&D Intensity: 74.3 M$ / 3,074.1 M$ = 2.4% confirmed", "Adjusted Operating Profit reconciliation verified from 10-K Note 1 table", "Restructuring Charges of 23.3 M$ confirmed from 10-K footnote (1) breakdown", "Contract-Manufactured Products revenue recalculated based on segment mix", "All unit corrections verified (B$ vs M$, % for percentages)", "YoY calculations validated against historical data from 10-K", "AI positioning confirmed as absent per 10-K review", "Risks section expanded with specific governance framework details from Item 1C"], "_held_for_review": true, "governance": {"agm_date": "2026-05-04", "fiscal_year": 2025, "ceo_name": "Eric M. Green", "ceo_total_comp_m": 7.19, "ceo_pay_ratio": 111, "exec_comp_approval_pct": 94, "board_independence_pct": 90.9, "board_size": 11, "avg_tenure_years": 9.4, "board_women_pct": 36, "voting_structure": "1 action = 1 vote, pas de double classe d actions, vote majoritaire pour les administrateurs en elections non contestees", "top_capital": [{"name": "Vanguard Group", "type": "institutionnel", "stake_pct": 13.49}, {"name": "BlackRock Inc.", "type": "institutionnel", "stake_pct": 8.4}], "comp_detail": {"source_fiscal_year": 2025, "ceo_salary_m": 1.18, "ceo_bonus_m": 0, "ceo_stock_awards_m": 3.33, "ceo_op